-- Liberty personal accident rules, UW-PAG-W-001-10-V: CÁC ĐIỀU KHOẢN ĐẶC BIỆT, special
-- provisions 1-9 (src 584-660).
--
-- Fork F19: special provisions 3, 4 and 8 state cover for their subject "với điều kiện là"
-- (on condition that). They are read as the cover for that subject, so their conditions bite:
-- an assault the insured provoked, a hijacking of a non-ticketed traveller, a motorcycle over
-- 150cc is not covered. LAW: Law 08/2022/QH15 art 24 (aid line 588-591) construes an unclear
-- term for the policyholder, which would read them as extensions that cut nothing back; that
-- reading is recorded in NOTES.md and not encoded.

§ `Special provisions`

§§ `1. Disappearance`

-- If the insured's body is not found within twelve months of the disappearance, by sinking or
-- wreck or air crash or another conveyance the insured travelled on, in covered circumstances,
-- the insured is treated as having died by Injury caused by an Accident, and the death and
-- permanent injury benefit is paid: the Company pays the limit to the legal representative.
-- "Within twelve months" is calendar months and includes its last day, so the deeming takes
-- effect from the day after (fork F20).
