GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`special provision 3 is not met by` c MEANS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `murder or assault on the insured` provoked THEN provoked
    OTHERWISE FALSE

§§ `4. Hijacking`

-- Cover extends to sudden Injury from the unlawful seizure or wrongful control of an aircraft
-- or ship licensed to carry passengers, or another conveyance, on which the insured is a
-- ticketed passenger, provided the insured did not take part in or provoke it; in every other
-- respect the contract's terms and its war and terrorism exclusions and other exclusions still
-- apply.
